WEBVTT

00:00:00.314 --> 00:00:04.920
Planning your week — Plan ahead, by week or by month — and copy what repeats.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:14.164
Plan shows your week, day by day, with planned (p) and actual (a) hours, and your totals at the top.

00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:19.288
+ plan this day adds a block: times, hour type, client, project and a description.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.691
Swipe a block to the left for its actions…

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:27.923
…Copy and Delete.

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:34.782
Copy it to the next day, or to the rest of this week — working days only.

00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:41.952
Done — Monday to Thursday now have it too. Every copy and delete has Undo.

00:00:42.579 --> 00:00:46.582
Copy this week to next week repeats the whole week in one go.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.982
Switch to Month for the whole month at a glance.

00:00:52.376 --> 00:00:56.379
Each day shows its planned hours. Tap a day to see and plan it.

00:01:01.232 --> 00:01:05.338
Plan · copy · adjust — More help: the Handbook → Week Planner.
